{"suttaId":"tha-ap227","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7870,7885],"vripara":"24"},"segments":{"tha-ap227:0.3":"Abyādhikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap227:1.1":"“Vipassissa bhagavato, aggisālaṃ adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap227:1.3":"Byādhikānañca āvāsaṃ, uṇhodakapaṭiggahaṃ.","tha-ap227:2.1":"“Tena kammenayaṃ mayhaṃ, attabhāvo sunimmito;","tha-ap227:2.3":"Byādhāhaṃ nābhijānāmi, puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap227:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ sālamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap227:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, aggisālāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap227:4.1":"“Ito ca sattame kappe, ekosiṃ aparājito [eko āsiṃ narādhipo (syā.)];","tha-ap227:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap227:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap227:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā abyādhiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap227:7.1":"Abyādhikattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
